   Scope: original firmware application code under firmware/, except drivers
   explicitly licensed separately and third-party components.
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt and firmware/LICENSE.

2. Original standalone drivers
   SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
   Scope includes the standalone ds3231.c and ds3231.h driver files,
