   Full text: LICENSES/MIT.txt. Individual driver notices also apply.

3. Original hardware design materials
   SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
   Scope: original hardware design files, schematics, PCB projects, Gerbers,
   BOMs and associated hardware documentation under hardware/.
   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt and hardware/LICENSE.

4. Bundled tools and third-party material
   ESP32 Flasher retains tools/esp-flasher/LICENSE.
   esptool and all other third-party components retain their respective
   licenses and copyright notices. See tools/esp-flasher/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
   and tools/esp-flasher/licenses/.

The firmware application license does not replace the MIT license of the
standalone driver files. Third-party material is not relicensed by this index.
